OL,3,AStand-up comic released after being
OL,4,Aconvicted of insulting ErdoD_an
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Istanbul court has convicted a
OL,7,Fpopular comedian of insulting President
OL,8,FRecep Tayyip ErdoD_an ` and handed down
OL,9,Fa sentence of almost 19 months ` but
OL,10,Fordered his release due to time served.
OL,12,FIt has also placed him under a travel
OL,13,Fban, preventing him from travelling
OL,14,Foutside Turkey.
OL,16,FA final decision in the case will come
OL,17,Ffrom the court of appeals.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
