OL,3,AStand-up comic released after being
OL,4,Aconvicted of insulting ErdoD_an
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeniz GoktaE_ - who denied the charges
OL,7,F- has already spent nearly 90 days in
OL,8,Fprison. Prosecutors had asked for up to
OL,9,F12 years. His case comes amid a wave of
OL,10,Farrests in Turkey that human rights
OL,11,Fgroups say is aimed at crushing
OL,12,Fdissent.
